      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Abdullah Bin Yahya Al Kahily who said, ",
          "‘I heard Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> saying: ‘Link (with each other), and do good and be compassionate, and sympathetic’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. It is narrated from him (narrator of the Hadith above) from Muhammad ibn Sinan from ‘Abd Allah ibn Yahya al-Kahili who has said the following: “I heard abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) saying, ‘Maintain good relations among yourselves, do good to one another, be compassionate and lenient to each other.’” "
        ]
      }
